# Our Next Date — Environment Configuration
#
# This application is 100% client-side with zero external backend dependencies.
# All data is stored privately in browser localStorage and shared via self-contained
# URL payload tokens (?share=...).
#
# No API keys or server configuration are required for local development or production.
# Deploy straight to Vercel, Netlify, Cloudflare Pages, or GitHub Pages without any env vars.
